Rule 1 (input must have a floating dtype supported by Lgamma)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor must have rank at least 1)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 3 (last dimension exists and its length is non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (all dimension sizes are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
